flowchart TD
    A[Validate clues] --> B{Empty cell?}
    B -->|No| C[Return solved grid]
    B -->|Yes| D[Try digits 1 to 9]
    D --> E{Allowed in row column and box?}
    E -->|Yes| F[Place digit and recurse]
    F --> G{Solved?}
    G -->|Yes| C
    G -->|No| H[Clear cell and try next digit]
    E -->|No| H
    H --> I{Candidates left?}
    I -->|Yes| D
    I -->|No| J[Backtrack]
